        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Wan, Leigh Whannell, Patrick Wilson, Rose Byrne, Barbara Hershey\n- Companies: Blumhouse Productions\n- Products: Insidious\n- Topics: supernatural horror films, low-budget horror films\n\nFacts:\n- James Wan was born on 27 February 1977 and is a Malaysian-Australian film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Insidious is a 2010 American-Canadian supernatural horror film.\n- Insidious was directed by James Wan and written by Leigh Whannell.\n- Insidious stars Patrick Wilson, Rose Byrne, and Barbara Hershey.\n- Blumhouse Productions is mostly known for producing low-budget horror films.\n- Blumhouse Productions is known for films including Paranormal Activity, Insidious, The Purge, Sinister, The Gift, Split, and Get Out.",
